          "source": 1,
          "target": 0
        }
      },
      "basis_path": "results/quinone_repair_2026_09_06/evidence/quinone_pathway_map.json",
      "note": "Existing target metabolite metadata are preserved. Source c and target C_c both denote the cytosol; only copied new-metabolite compartment labels are normalized. Stored source and target metabolite metadata are therefore not byte-identical. Shared target charges of zero are placeholders, not newly validated chemical charges. Any undeclared formula, compartment, or charge difference aborts the transfer."
    },
    "pool_weights": {
      "q8_c": 1.0,
